  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1788/941/dappas-png.png\" alt=\"是的\"></p>\n<h1>Kofi: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdaffatheone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/daffatheone</a></h1>\n<h1>PayPal 支持: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fDaffatheOne\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://paypal.me/DaffatheOne</a></h1>\n<p><strong>使用前请确保已安装 TACZ！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>建议在 FOV（视野）设置为 90 时使用，以获得正确的准星位置！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>这是一个模组……请将其安装到 mods 文件夹中</strong></p>\n<h3>感谢以下捐赠者：Sabastien, Antony, Monica</h3>\n<h1>介绍 Daffa 的军火库</h1>\n<p>唯一一款能带来接近最新《使命召唤》游戏射击手感的 TACZ 模组。</p>\n<p>是的</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入已移除: <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2f3NdvrUsqil4\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/3NdvrUsqil4</a> </span></span></span>\n<span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入已移除: <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fotIswXnHbEA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/otIswXnHbEA</a> </span></span></span>\n<h1>武器列表</h1>\n<h3>HK-416</h3>\n<h3>以及更多</h3>\n<h1>配件列表</h1>\n<h3>以及更多</h3>\n<h1>鸣谢</h1>\n<h3>DaffaTheOne (Gunpack)</h3>\n<h3>Corrineduck (Compiler)</h3>",
